-- the markup table and the host agree, tag by tag --
  every pair was asked: true
  and answered the same way by both: true
-- and the answer is the one the control gives --
  every control was asked about every property: true
  and did exactly what the rule promised: true
  no value was out of range: true
-- the three answers a caller has to be able to tell apart --
  a label has no checked state: true
  and it does have a font size: true
  a slider carries a step: true
  and was told yes or told the platform cannot: true
  a layout name belongs to no control: true
